abstract: >
  Unified pure-Rust Structural Equation Modeling (aetiocore-sem) and White-Box Causal Deep Learning (aetiocore-sem-dl)
  monorepo library supporting condition-based maintenance and scientific modeling, funded by the European Union Erasmus+ CBHE
  project ECO-WIND (Grant No. ERASMUS-EDU-2025-CBHE-101177220) and engineered for low-footprint execution
  (wheel size < 5 MiB, benchmark Peak RSS <= 150.0 MiB).
